          "caption": null,
          "code": "def F(n):\n    return G(n-1)\n\ndef G(n):\n    if n < 10:\n        return n\n    return G(n-2) + 1\n\ncount = 0\nfor n in range(1, 100+1):\n    x = F(n)\n    if x > 0:\n        if int(x**0.5)**2 == x:\n            count += 1\nprint(count)",
